# ARGOS: права по топикам. OTA-команду панели может отправлять только argos (X230).
user argos
topic readwrite #

user homeassistant
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite argos/home/#
topic read argos/#

user panel7
topic read argos/#
topic readwrite argos/panel7/status
topic write argos/panel7/telemetry
topic write argos/home/corridor/power/set
topic write homeassistant/+/argos_panel7/#
